# Bob ignore rules for changesafe-future-incident-lab
#
# Rationale for each group is documented inline.
# Direct @file mentions in Bob tasks can bypass these rules -- never mention a secret file by path.
# Source code, tests, ChangeSafe artifacts, and evidence needed for the demo are NOT ignored.

# -- Build output --------------------------------------------------------------
# Maven build output -- large, regenerated on every build, not source.
target/

# Compiled Java bytecode (may appear outside target/ in some IDE configs)
**/*.class

# Packaged JARs and WARs (build artifacts, not source)
**/*.jar
**/*.war

# -- IDE and editor metadata ---------------------------------------------------
# IntelliJ IDEA project files -- local IDE state, not project conventions.
.idea/

# Maven wrapper binary cache -- not source.
.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.jar

# -- Log noise -----------------------------------------------------------------
# Log files in the project root or build directories -- these are runtime noise.
# EXCEPTION: changesafe/evidence/**/logs/*.log files are RETAINED (evidence artifacts).
*.log
!changesafe/evidence/**/*.log

# -- Docker / runtime only -----------------------------------------------------
# docker-compose.yml is runtime infrastructure, not application logic.
# Ignore to prevent Bob from loading it as application context.
docker-compose.yml

# -- Explicit retains (documentation) -----------------------------------------
# The following are NOT ignored -- listed here as documentation only.
# src/                          retained: application source and tests
# .bob/                         retained: Bob configuration (modes, skills, rules)
# changesafe/                   retained: templates, scripts, evidence, README
# bob_sessions/                 retained: hackathon consumption screenshots
# CHANGESAFE_BOB_BUILD_BRIEF.md retained: build specification
# CHANGESAFE_OUTPUT_CONTRACT.md retained: output format specification
# pom.xml                       retained: build definition
# README.md                     retained: project documentation
# LICENSE                       retained: MIT license attribution (required)
# lombok.config                 retained: Lombok configuration
